 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello! How's everything today?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good so far.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My front step is crumbling. Is that a concrete job or what?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sounds like it. Is it just the edges breaking off, or are there big chunks missing?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Mostly the front edge. Bits come off when I sweep.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a concrete patching mix should do it. You can buy small bags that only need water.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Do I need to build a frame thing?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "For an edge, yes, a simple board held in front of it as a mold. Brush off loose bits first and wet the old concrete.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How long before I can walk on it?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.61,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Give it at least a day, ideally two. Put a little sign up so the postman doesn't step on it.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.82,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg24"
  }
 ]
